WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,700
We have too much food here

2
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:03,700
I would rather lose money outside every day

3
00:00:03,780 --> 00:00:05,780
I don’t even want to go back to the base to drink the vegetable soup set rice.

4
00:00:09,830 --> 00:00:11,030
Your rice tastes so delicious

5
00:00:11,550 --> 00:00:14,950
I've seen this look a lot in my last life

6
00:00:15,350 --> 00:00:17,830
No one in this life has dared to look at me like this

7
00:00:18,030 --> 00:00:19,030
I'm from the team next door

8
00:00:19,270 --> 00:00:21,230
Thank you for taking action today. My name is Huo Feng.

9
00:00:21,310 --> 00:00:22,430
Did we spare you?

10
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:24,980
Brother, you must be the boss, right?

11
00:00:25,060 --> 00:00:26,380
The air and rain are noisy and the bamboo ears are extraordinary

12
00:00:26,460 --> 00:00:28,820
If you go here, you will act like a dragon and a shrimp, and you will be so powerful and domineering.

13
00:00:29,580 --> 00:00:33,780
What do you want to be the second boss?

14
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:43,280
Brother, your temperament is calm, low-key and reserved. Your team must be all elite but weak. What on earth do you want to say? I want to join you. I am an entertainer. You definitely need it.

15
00:00:43,830 --> 00:00:44,990
What kind of art can turn like this?
